WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.560
All of us are at least 20 years old!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.480
"Shed those winter pounds"!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.990
I'm gonna bring out my inner woman!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.660
I'm home!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.410
Oh, Michiru. Welcome back.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.870
Look, look. I got some old-time snacks!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.380
It hit me that this kinda stuff
would go great with booze.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.630
Wanna try?

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.170
<i>Farewell, O woman that could have been!</i>

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.520
A girl from work brought these for everyone to snack on.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:10.900
Having these once in a while sure takes you back...
and makes you kinda happy, huh?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:15.150
Come to think of it, there was one of those
old-time snack shops close to our hometown.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.780
It was kind of small, but it was STACKED
with all kinds of snacks.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.160
It's fun choosing something from out of all that, right?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.200
He's not here either, huh?

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:24.910
Huh?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.420
Personally, I think it's the supermarket snack corner
that's made the biggest impression on me...

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.090
C'mon Makoto, let's get this.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:38.090
No way. I want <i>that</i> one!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.590
All right, you two...

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.680
Hurry up and <i>choose</i>.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.520
Mom would stay mad
till we finally chose something, huh?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.390
So, that's why you gotta have some too, Michiru!

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.400
I-I respectfully decline!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.190
How come?

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.440
I have to shed these winter pounds, so...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.480
Come on, thighs!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.860
I swear...

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.990
you always buy into
whatever the magazines say...

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.200
I haven't made it to the gym recently,
but I have to at least get some of my body back!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.790
Hup! Leg... lifts!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.330
Whaaat?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.870
Um, what's next?

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.380
This will loosen up my back!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.680
Voila.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.680
Fine, but just one!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.730
<i>There's a good girl...</i>

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:31.770
Huh?

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.230
Well, here you go.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.310
Why'd you crush it?!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.240
Why wouldn't you want to eat it in all its tubular glory?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.740
Trust me. Just open it.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:45.240
Whoa!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.490
It split into four perfect pieces!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.540
Now you can eat it without dirtying
the sides of your mouth.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.000
Such feminine attention to detail!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:55.710
Like <i>this</i>?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.510
In cases like these...

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.010
What happened to femininity?!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.560
These have a pretty strong flavor, don't they?

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.600
It makes you want more, and just gobble them up!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.190
And so! That's why, about an hour ago, I thought...

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.480
these could go great with booze!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.400
<i>That's sort of random.</i>

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:23.240
And if you're pairing with junky snacks,
then a snacky kind of booze would be best.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.910
A snacky kind of booze... A booze that is a snack...

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.660
And this booze right here has replicated
the very <i>essence</i> of snacks!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.910
What?!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.330
Behold!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.500
"Otoko Ume Sour"!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.500
This drink perfectly recreates
that "Manly Pickled Plum" candy!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.710
The one that has the plum with those huge muscles?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.680
In any case, this snack
will make you beeline for the booze.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.480
And then...!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.190
That looks sour!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.820
The pickled plum is so <i>real</i>
that once you get through it, you feel refreshed!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.950
That's what makes an Otoko Ume Sour!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.200
Well, go on.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.330
Thanks so-!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.120
I can't! That is not an option!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.960
I already have to work off the calories from that Umaibo.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.040
You're so friggin' stubborn.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.460
Fine, I'll just enjoy this in my own way.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.460
Huh?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.470
<i>I thought for sure she'd try
to force something on me again...</i>

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.970
<i>What is she doing?</i>

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.890
<i>Is that salt?!</i>

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.970
<i>She's coated the rim of that beer mug with it.</i>

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.350
<i>Then she added a bunch of ice...</i>

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.650
<i>And now the Otoko Ume Sour!</i>

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.110
<i>Now she's added a real pickled plum!</i>

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.230
<i>This is...</i>

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.240
The Three-Tiered Approach to the Otoko Ume Sour!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.280
A salted rim!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.280
An added pickled plum!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.990
And then, the final piece that brings it all together...

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.740
A crust of pickled plum salt!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.080
<i>That looks really salty... and really sour.</i>

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.750
<i>H-huh? I'm drooling!</i>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.300
What's this? Weren't you supposed to be exercising?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.130
I-I'm just taking a little break.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:13.260
Actually, pickled plums are good for you
and keep you from getting fat, right...?

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.850
Yeah, probably.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:24.690
I want some! Please, let me have some!
Give me a taste of that pickled plum salt crust!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.780
<i>All according to plan.</i>

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.370
Ottimo!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:37.620
"Ottimo"?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:42.670
It's salty and sour...
It's the flavor of that manly candy!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.170
The more salt you drink in, the sweeter the liquor tastes!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:52.680
Crushing a pickled plum and adding the pulp
makes it even MORE decadent!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.060
Also...!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:56.680
Fine, I don't care, I'll eat it!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.180
I'm home.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.940
Welcome back!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:04.320
C'mon and join us, Kae. We're pairing
junky snacks with Otoko Ume Sour!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.320
I'll pass. It's already late.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.200
Plus, it's easy to get fat in winter
but hard to shed those pounds.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.370
A little will be fine, trust me!

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:16.660
R-really? Well, maybe I'll have just one.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.790
<i>She...!</i>

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.590
<i>She left all those crumbs right there!</i>

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.710
This<i> is how adults act when they're eating snacks?!</i>

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.430
You okay, Michiru?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.850
<i>I want some of those "adult" crumbs too!</i>

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.730
Try it, Kae. It's sour and super delish!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.440
They say you crave sour things
when you've overexerted yourself.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:48.190
Yeah, my body's been popping
left and right these days.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.700
I have to stand at work,
and the blood don't circulate right when it's cold,

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:56.240
so once the day's done,
I just want to go straight to a hot spring!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:00.500
A hot spring sure would be nice.
It would be so soothing...

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.870
Right? You want to take a break, right?!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.080
Hot spring! Hot spring!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:09.170
Speaking of, they say you crave sour things
when you feel <i>unfulfilled</i> too.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.970
Well, it's almost Christmas,

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.260
so we're getting more and more couples in.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.020
<i>An unintended dis!</i>

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.900
This "Otoko Ume Sour" is quite tasty, isn't it?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.400
Yeah...

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.070
It really gets you, in the body but also in the heart.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:33.990
We may not have men,
but at least we have this manly sour drink...

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.910
Next up: Cheese crackers!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:49.300
These crackers went on sale in 1972
and have been a best seller.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:54.220
They're light and crispy, and once you experience
the kind, gentle flavor and aroma of the cheese,

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.180
you won't be able to stop yourself!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.180
Oh, something nice and gentle is always welcome.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.770
We should try to have more
of these simple pleasures, huh?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.190
<i>They both seem pretty tired...</i>

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.110
All these make such great side snacks!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.550
These Rice Ball Crackers use premium rice,

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.200
and the coarse salt matches perfectly with the Otoko Ume Sour.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.830
The Otoko Ume Sour is versatile enough
to go with ANY snack!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.500
I only wanted a bite or two, but I ended up eating a lot...

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.090
Michiru, it's about time for today's main event!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.000
"Main event"?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.590
Octopus rice crackers with savory sauce!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.720
Slap it between two Big Katsu and you've got
an Octopus Rice Cracker Katsu Sandwich!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.350
If you ask me, you should add some mayonnaise too.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.770
How decadent it feels to simply ignore calories!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.560
It's so glorious!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.110
<i>Wait, those...</i>

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.610
<i>Those are "adult" crumbs!</i>

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.990
I, Michiru, will have an Octopus Katsu sandwich too!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.660
<i>Finally, I get to...</i>

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.080
<i>Th-they're on my </i>stomach<i>!</i>

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.210
The Octopus Katsu is good stuff, huh?
Let's scarf up some more!

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.760
For me, this shall be the Last Supper!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.180
Huh?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.390
<i>I'll do my best to bring out
my inner woman - </i>tomorrow<i>.</i>

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.690
So, this "Otoko Ume" stuff isn't just candy:

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:05.240
It's real pickled plums and tablets and gummies
and jelly snacks and soft drinks - all kinds of things.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.790
I wonder if any of them would go well
with the Otoko Ume Sour...

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.290
I'm drooling just thinking about it!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.460
Here's to another night!
